.Sh HISTORY
These are the C forms of differential dataflow's
.Vt Collection
type and its linear methods
.Pq map , filter , flat_map , concat , negate , consolidate , inspect , explode , delay , enter , leave
and the difference classes of
.Pa difference.rs .
.Sh THREAD SAFETY
A
.Vt dtfl_collection
handle and the collection operators belong to the worker thread that
builds the dataflow and must not be shared.
A
.Vt dtfl_diff
is immutable once created and its reference count is atomic, so a
diff class may be shared between threads.
